    "$schema": "../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json",
    "// lint": "Taro 的依赖树被 auto-install-peers 塞进一个 eslint 8.41（@eslint-community/eslint-utils 的 peer），它的 .bin 会盖住根上的 eslint 10，flat config 直接找不到。所以显式走根二进制，而不是 @nx/eslint/plugin 推断出的裸 `eslint .`。",
    "// serve": "微信小程序没有 dev server：`serve` 就是 watch 构建，产物仍在 dist/，用微信开发者工具打开本目录（project.config.json 的 miniprogramRoot 指向 dist/）即可热更。watch 模式下 NODE_ENV=development，@tarojs/plugin-framework-react 才会挂上 @vitejs/plugin-react，它把 `@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators` 以字符串形式交给 babel，由 babel 从 app 根解析——所以那个插件必须显式列进本项目 devDependencies，光靠 babel-preset-taro 的传递依赖在 pnpm 下解析不到。",
    "projectType": "application",
    "sourceRoot": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram/src",
    "implicitDependencies": []
  },
  "dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e": {
    "root": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e",
    "targets": {
      "typecheck": {
        "dependsOn": ["^typecheck"],
        "cache": true,
        "inputs": [
          "{projectRoot}/package.json",
          "{workspaceRoot}/tsconfig.base.json",
          "{projectRoot}/tsconfig.json",
          "{projectRoot}/**/*.ts",
          "{projectRoot}/playwright.config.ts",
          "{projectRoot}/src/**/*.spec.ts",
          "{projectRoot}/src/**/*.d.ts",
          "!{projectRoot}/out-tsc/**/*",
          "!{projectRoot}/test-output/**/*",
          "!{projectRoot}/eslint.config.js",
          "!{projectRoot}/eslint.config.mjs",
          "!{projectRoot}/eslint.config.cjs",
          {
            "dependentTasksOutputFiles": "**/*.{d.ts,d.cts,d.mts,tsbuildinfo}",
            "transitive": true
          },
          {
            "fileset": "{projectRoot}/**/*.{d.ts,d.cts,d.mts}",
            "dependencies": true
          }
        ],
        "outputs": [
          "{projectRoot}/out-tsc/playwright/**/*.{d.ts,d.cts,d.mts}",
          "{projectRoot}/out-tsc/playwright/**/*.{d.ts,d.cts,d.mts}.map",
          "{projectRoot}/out-tsc/playwright/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo"
        ],
        "syncGenerators": ["@nx/js:typescript-sync"],
        "metadata": {
          "technologies": ["typescript"],
          "description": "Runs type-checking for the project.",
          "help": {
            "command": "pnpm exec tsc --build --help",
            "example": {
              "args": ["--force"]
            }
          }
        },
        "executor": "nx:run-commands",
        "options": {
          "cwd": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e",
          "command": "tsc --build tsconfig.json --emitDeclarationOnly"
        },
        "configurations": {},
        "parallelism": true
      },
      "lint": {
        "cache": true,
        "inputs": ["default", "^production"],
        "executor": "nx:run-commands",
        "options": {
          "command": "node ../../node_modules/eslint/bin/eslint.js .",
          "cwd": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e"
        },
        "configurations": {},
        "parallelism": true
      },
      "e2e-devtools": {
        "// executor": "不能靠 @nx/playwright 插件推断 target：插件只认 `targetName`（本仓是 e2e），推断出来的名字正好是要躲开的那个。nx.json 里已经把本项目从该插件排除，所以命令在这里显式写死。",
        "dependsOn": ["dev-rxdb-miniprogram:build"],
        "executor": "nx:run-commands",
        "options": {
          "cwd": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e",
          "command": "node ../../node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js test"
        },
        "configurations": {},
        "parallelism": true
      }
    },
    "name": "dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e",
    "tags": ["npm:private", "miniprogram-app"],
    "metadata": {
      "targetGroups": {},
      "js": {
        "packageName": "@aiao/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e",
        "packageVersion": "0.0.1",
        "isInPackageManagerWorkspaces": true
      }
    },
    "$schema": "../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json",
    "// dependsOn": "被测对象是 taro build 产出的 dist/（project.config.json 的 miniprogramRoot 指向它），开发者工具打开的就是这份产物。没有产物时必须红在构建上，而不是红在一条看不懂的选择器超时上。",
    "// e2e-devtools": "target **不能**叫 `e2e`。ci-template.yml 的 plan 步骤用 `nx show projects --withTarget=e2e` 自动发现矩阵（「不写死清单：新增 e2e 应用自动进矩阵」），而全部 runner 都是 ubuntu-latest。本套件要驱动 GUI 版微信开发者工具，只在 macOS / Windows 上存在，叫 `e2e` 就会被拉进 Linux job 并必然红。`pnpm test-all` 的 `-t ... e2e` 同理。改名让它留在「显式本地门禁」这一侧：想跑的人得自己敲 `nx e2e-devtools dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e`。",
    "projectType": "application",
    "sourceRoot": "apps/dev-rxdb-miniprogram-e2e/src",
    "implicitDependencies": ["dev-rxdb-miniprogram"]
  },
